# Master Farmer - Grindbot

Read and follow `C:\Users\ebene\OneDrive\Desktop\_MASTER-FARMER_\AGENTS.md`
before any change (shared Cursor + Claude rules). This file is product
release workflow only.

The project home (main folder) is `C:\Users\ebene\OneDrive\Desktop\_MASTER-FARMER_\`.
Open `_MASTER-FARMER_\products_src\restedXP_questing` for work. Local version builds go
in `_MASTER-FARMER_\Grindbot_Versions\`; the older ones stay in `Desktop\SNES_\`.

The essentials, so they are never missed:

- Every material change: bump `version.lua` + every `-- Version:` banner, add a
  `VERSIONING.md` row, run `python make_local.py` (regenerates `manifest.lua`).
- Then commit on `dev`, push, open the PR to `main` and **merge it** — the game
  loads from GitHub `main`, so uncommitted work never reaches it.
- One loader only: the Master Farmer launcher loads this bot. Never add a loader
  folder (the old `plugin_loader/` was retired in 3.4.1).
- Only use APIs declared in the `.api` stubs (`AGENTS.md` §2).
